{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_st02","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":18,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-ST-2","storyName":"幻梦终醒，猎魂不息","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"梓兰等人回到了泰拉，还带了些土特产，泡影国也回归平静，而“雷之主”，也回到了属于它的国度。风沙停歇，旭日东升。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_st02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_st02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":16,"characters":["斑点","月见夜","泡普卡","空爆","梓兰","政宗","义经","宝巫迦","斑弥罗","武士","急躁的猎人","冷静的猎人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sand02","flip":"2","layer":"1","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"text","text":"风，是这场混乱中唯一的主宰。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"斑点正用他那面巨大的盾牌，艰难地为自己和身后的泡普卡撑起一片小小的、摇摇欲坠的安全区。","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"咳、咳……麻烦死了！这沙子都要钻进我肺里了！月见夜，你那边怎么样了？！","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"还行！最后两个沙盗已经被我解决了！你那边呢？泡普卡还好吗？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"她好得很，一直躲在我后面，一粒沙子都吃不着！倒是你，解决完了就快点过来帮忙！我快顶不住了！","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"我的新漫画还在罗德岛等我，我可不想不明不白地死在这里！","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"冷静点，斑点，再坚持一下，梓兰小姐和空爆一定会来支援的！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"（好可怕……风沙好大……我什么都看不清了……）","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"（斑点哥哥……他的盾牌在晃……他快要顶不住了……）","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"（咦？那个人……是沙盗！他躲过了月见夜哥哥！）","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"斑点哥哥！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"斑点，小心身后！","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"什么？！","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"（他转不过来！来不及了！那把刀……那把刀要砍下去了！）","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"（不要——不要伤害斑点哥哥！）","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"bgeffect","id":41},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_bg_white.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"一股奇特的、灼热的东西突然从她的眼底涌出。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"她甚至来不及思考那是什么，只是遵循着本能，将那股力量对准了那个沙盗的方向。","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"一道几乎看不见的能量光束，从她的眼中一闪而过。","id":48},{"type":"text","text":"它没有击中任何人。","id":49},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_beamamb","volume":"1","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"嗡——","id":53},{"type":"text","text":"一声仿佛来自大地之外的奇异嗡鸣响起，紧接着，一道无形的冲击波扩散开来。","id":54},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"刚才那是什么？！","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"不知道！好像有什么东西炸了？喂！泡普卡，你没事吧？！","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"嗯……泡普卡没事……","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"泡普卡呆呆地站在原地，她自己也不知道刚才发生了什么。她只看到那个坏人飞了出去，斑点哥哥安全了。","id":67},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":74},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":75,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"……结束了？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们……回来了？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"好像是……刚才那场狩猎……那个“御轮”……宝巫迦……时间过去了多久？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"一声清脆的、与这片沙漠格格不入的叫声，从她们身后响起。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这里……难道是远方的封印之地喵？","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"1","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$7","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（失望的低鸣）","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"政宗？！义经？！","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"看来这不是一场梦。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":102},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"梓兰小姐！空爆！你们跑哪里去了！","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_char_283_midn_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":107},{"type":"charslot","id":108},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":109},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"1.5","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"喂——！你们两个，刚才失联了一分多钟，我还以为你们被沙子埋了呢！","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰和空爆回头看去，只见自己熟悉的月见夜、斑点和泡普卡正朝她们跑来。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"刚才突然起了一阵怪风，然后你们就失联了，我们都快急死了！还好战斗已经结束了。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"multiline","name":"月见夜","text":"你们没事吧？","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#2","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"multiline","name":"月见夜","text":"咦，你们什么时候换的衣服？还挺别致的。","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"何止是衣服，你们身后的云兽和牙兽又是从哪来的？看起来伙食很好的样子。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"梓兰姐姐！空爆姐姐！你们没事，真是太好了！","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"看着眼前这三个自己再熟悉不过的“问题儿童”，又看了看身后那两个新伙伴，梓兰感到哭笑不得。","id":127},{"type":"text","text":"一瞬间，她想起了独立自主的宝巫迦，想起了那个开朗的斑弥罗，想起了那个为了守护重要之人和国家而变得固执的月见夜。","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"她觉得自己变了，变得温柔了一些。","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"具体的事情我会慢慢跟你们说。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"总而言之，月见夜，斑点，泡普卡，你们没事就好。这次任务的混乱，是我的指挥失误，让你们担心了，辛苦你们了。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"……","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"……","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_281_popka_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"……","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"嗯？怎么了？","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"喂喂，你是谁啊？你不是我们的队长吧？我们的队长只会叹着气骂我们是问题儿童。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#4","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"确实……这温柔的语气，这坦率的道歉……小姐，你是不是被沙尘暴里的什么东西附身了？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我认识几个懂秘术的姐妹，要不我们去看一看吧？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_char_283_midn_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"啊哦。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"你们两个家伙！我难得想当个好队长你们还不乐意了是吧？！任务报告！","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.53","scale":"1.05","duration":"0","id":153},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","screenadapt":"coverall","id":154},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"50","randomness":"60","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":155},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"现在！","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.53","scale":"1.1","duration":"0","id":157},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"0","screenadapt":"coverall","id":158},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"50","randomness":"60","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":159},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"立刻！","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.53","scale":"1.15","duration":"0","id":161},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","fadetime":"0","screenadapt":"coverall","id":162},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"50","randomness":"60","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":163},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"马上！","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"把刚才发生的所有事情给我一五一十地写清楚！还有，月见夜！你又去哪里认识了懂秘术的姐妹，嗯？","id":165},{"type":"charslot","id":166},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_283_midn_1#2","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"报告长官，此事说来话长！","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_char_283_midn_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_284_spot_1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"啊……这回是梓兰没错了。那我继续看漫画了，月见夜，等你搞清楚发生了什么后，记得跟我说一声。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑点","text":"最好三十字以内。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_char_284_spot_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嗯，有的时候我也觉得有些事真怪不了梓兰姐。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_281_popka_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡普卡","text":"梓兰姐姐！","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_281_popka_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"唉，还是我们家的泡普卡最好了。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"对了，政宗。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"喵？","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这样吧，要不然，你们跟我们一起，先回我们的家吧？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"你们的家喵？","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"没错，是一个叫罗德岛的好地方。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_71_g3_impermanence_palace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":206},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":207,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"西城的市场可以再扩大一些，斑弥罗，你的那些新发明，也该让国民们都见识一下了。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"没问题，陛下！我最新改良的“全自动兔团子机”，保证能让大家随时随地都吃到美味的团子！","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"在此之前，我认为还有一件事要做。我们应该在都城的中央广场上，为我们的英雄们建一座雕像。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是啊……为了梓兰小姐、空爆小姐、政宗大人和义经大人，还有过往的“异兽猎人”们。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"但愿他们已经平安回到自己的家乡了。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"对了，如果可以的话，吾希望为“雷之主”也立一座雕像。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这是为何？","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾不是为了纪念它，或者可怜它……只是，为了记住它。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"……好。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"泡影国确实应当记住“雷之主”。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我们能做的，就是将他们的故事，和这个国家的历史一起，永远流传下去。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"说起来，还真是有点想念他们啊。虽然空爆老是嘲笑我的发明，但没有她的武器，我的击龙枪也确实造不出来。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"还有政宗，那家伙虽然嘴碎，但给的东西都是真材实料……","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是啊……不知怎么的，虽然现在很和平，但总觉得……有些空落落的。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"text","text":"月见夜和宝巫迦的视线再次相遇，这一次，不再有隔阂与对立。","id":239},{"type":"text","text":"就在这时，一名武士神色古怪地走了进来。","id":240},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"启禀陛下、将军……城外有两位猎人求见。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"猎人？来自哪里？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"她们说……她们来自遥远的大地——","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦心中一动，一种难以言喻的预感涌上心头。她快步走出议事厅，来到了城门前。","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"3","id":253},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"3","fadetime":"1.5","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_bg_71_g1_impermanence_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":262},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"城门外，站着两个风尘仆仆的身影。","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"其中一人，身着一套如同紫色火焰般的优雅猎人套装，手持长弓，正警惕地打量着四周的环境。","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"而另一人，则一身青蓝色护甲，充满野性气息，背上背着一对巨大的剑盾，正一脸无聊地用脚尖踢着地上的石子。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"她们的衣着、神态、武器……都和宝巫迦记忆深处的那两个人有一些出入。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"但是，那两张脸，却是一模一样。","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","focus":"l","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急躁的猎人","text":"我听说这里有值得挑战的野兽，才跋山涉水过来的，你这家伙，该不会想和我抢吧？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冷静的猎人","text":"我只是听说泡影国周边的野兽身上有非常稀有的素材，如果传闻属实，那就各凭本事。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","focus":"l","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急躁的猎人","text":"哈，那敢情好！","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……梓兰小姐？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……空爆小姐？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":284},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"charslot","id":288},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":292},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":293,"musicid":3},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","block":"false","id":294},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"时空的撕扯感只是一瞬。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"当雷狼龙再次睁开双眼时，扑面而来的，不再是泡影国地下遗迹那混合着尘土与“诅咒”的死寂气息。","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"是风。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"是夹杂着潮湿泥土、青草芬芳和清冽水汽的风。是它自诞生之日起，就无比熟悉的风。","id":301},{"type":"text","text":"它抬起头，皎洁的月光穿过茂密的树冠，在布满青苔的地面上洒下斑驳的银辉。它听到了远处瀑布的轰鸣，听到了林间虫豸的鸣叫。","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"它回来了。","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"压抑在身体里十年的、属于巫女的那份沉重力量已经消失，纠缠在灵魂中那份污浊的“诅咒”也已烟消云散。","id":304},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalroar1","volume":"1","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"它发出一声悠长的、不再带有痛苦与愤怒的咆哮。那吼声不再是为了威慑，而是为了宣告——这片山林真正的王者，回来了。","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_speedline","layer":"1","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_ridedragon_walk1","volume":"1","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_ridedragon_walk2","volume":"1","id":313},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"它开始奔跑。","id":315},{"type":"text","text":"矫健的四肢在林间飞跃，利爪刨开熟悉的泥土，强壮的身躯撞开挡路的灌木。","id":316},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_ridedragon_walk1","volume":"1","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_ridedragon_walk2","volume":"1","id":320},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"它跃过湍急的溪流，在瀑布下驻足，任由冰凉的水花冲刷着自己满是伤痕的鳞甲，洗去那不属于这个世界的尘埃。","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_ridedragon_walk1","volume":"1","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_ridedragon_walk2","volume":"1","id":326},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":327},{"type":"bgeffect","id":328},{"type":"text","text":"它循着记忆，找到了一处悬崖。那里是它的王座。它安静地卧下，将巨大的头颅枕在前爪上，金色的长尾如疲倦的蛇般，盘在身侧。","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"它闭上了眼睛，安然地陷入了沉睡。","id":330},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":333},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":335},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_bg_coldforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"……","id":337},{"type":"text","text":"啪。","id":338},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":340},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":341},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":342},{"type":"text","text":"一声轻微的树枝断裂声，让它的耳朵猛地一抖。","id":343},{"type":"text","text":"它瞬间睁开了双眼，兽瞳在黑夜中亮起，睡意荡然无存。","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"它听到了。","id":345},{"type":"text","text":"那是一种沉稳的、富有节奏的、属于两足生物的脚步声。一步，又一步，正不紧不慢地向这里靠近。","id":346},{"type":"text","text":"那脚步声中，没有恐惧，只有坚定。","id":347},{"type":"text","text":"雷狼龙缓缓地站起身，望向声音传来的方向，一个身影从树林的阴影中走出。","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"那是一个猎人，头戴着宽大的竹制斗笠，身上穿着红蓝相间的结云衣，脚下的木屐踩在岩石上，发出轻微而清脆的“嗒嗒”声。","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"他的手中，握着一把修长的太刀，刀身在月光下反射出内敛而锋利的光芒。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"他同样看到了悬崖上的雷狼龙。","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"四目相对。","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"没有憎恨，没有恐惧。","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_normal","volume":"1","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":356},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$MHR_sys_monsterhunter2_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act50side/m_sys_monsterhunter2_loop.mp3","volume":"0.5","id":357,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"雷狼龙的肌肉开始隆起，一缕缕金色的雷光开始在它蓝玉般的鳞甲上跳动、闪烁。它低下头，发出一声低沉的、充满了战意的咆哮。","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"这是一种古老的、刻在它血脉中的宿命。","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"它不理解何为“英雄”，也不在乎何为“牺牲”。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"它只知道，在它的世界里，当一位强者，与另一位强者相遇时，战斗，便是唯一的，也是最高的敬意。","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"bgeffect","id":367},{"type":"gridbg","id":368},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":369},{"type":"image","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371}],"characters":["斑点","月见夜","泡普卡","空爆","梓兰","政宗","义经","宝巫迦","斑弥罗","武士","急躁的猎人","冷静的猎人"]}